      "title": "寒屋生计",
      "duration": 24,
      "narration": "窗纸被风顶得轻响，屋中一时没人先开口。狗儿挪到屋中靠前处，抬眼望向炕前。",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "at": 7,
          "until": 17,
          "speaker": "gouer",
          "to": [
            "granny"
          ],
          "mode": "normal",
          "text": "娘，这冬衣冬粮还没着落，您老说，咱还能寻哪条路？",
          "knowledgeRefs": []
        },
        {
          "at": 18,
          "until": 23,
          "speaker": "granny",
          "to": [
            "gouer",
            "liushi"
          ],
          "mode": "normal",
          "text": "路是人走出来的，先别愁断气。",
          "knowledgeRefs": [
            "first:0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "commands": [
        {
          "at": 0,
